*.bak
*.bak-*

# R&D scratch: p0 embedder bake-off. Track the harness SCRIPTS (version-controlled
# after a GC loss); ignore only the disposable heavy artifacts.
# Corpus storage (277MB data/) is DEFERRED to a durable off-tree backup, NOT plain git.
evals/p0-embedder-bakeoff/data/
evals/p0-embedder-bakeoff/out/
evals/p0-embedder-bakeoff/**/__pycache__/
evals/p0-embedder-bakeoff/*.log
# belief-eval's scorers now share decision-run/adjvocab.py, so importing it writes bytecode.
evals/belief-eval/**/__pycache__/

